 "Le premier / La première": {"z":{"h":"premier 读音像「破米耶」→ 第一个冲线，撞破米袋，耶！","r":"premier ≈ prime / primary（首要的），拉丁 primus","s":"想象冠军冲线时撞破米袋（le premier）；阳性 premier 结尾 r 不发音，读「耶」；阴性 la première 的 è 带重音，结尾 r 要读出来"},"e":{"h":"sounds like 'pruh-MYAY' — the first runner yells 'it's MY day!'","r":"premier ≈ prime and primary, from Latin primus (first)","s":"Picture a runner breaking the finish tape first (le premier); in the masculine the final r is silent, but in the feminine première (grave accent) the r sounds."}},
 "Aujourd'hui": {"z":{"h":"aujourd'hui 读音像「哦猪堆」→ 今天哦，院子里一堆猪","r":"aujourd'hui 原义「在今天这一天」：au + jour + d'hui（hui＝今天，拉丁 hodie）","s":"想象日历上用红笔圈出今天（aujourd'hui）；拼写 au-jour-d'-hui 中间有一个撇号；h 不发音，ui 读「wi」"},"e":{"h":"sounds like 'oh-zhoor-DWEE' — 'Oh! Jour-dwee — today is the day!'","r":"aujourd'hui = au + jour + d'hui, literally 'on the day of this day'; jour is the 'day' in journal and journey","s":"Picture a calendar with today's date circled in red: au-jour-d'hui, with an apostrophe in the middle. The h is silent and ui sounds like 'wee'."}},
 "Demain": {"z":{"h":"demain 读音像「的忙」→ 明天可有的忙了！","r":"demain ← 拉丁 de mane，「到早晨」→ 明天","s":"想象今晚睡下，明早日程表上写满事情（demain）；ai 读鼻音，n 不单独发音；Demain, je vais au cinéma"},"e":{"h":"sounds like 'duh-MAN' — 'Duh, man, I'll do it tomorrow!'","r":"demain ← Latin de mane, 'by morning'","s":"Picture a man lying in bed saying 'Duh, man, I'll do it tomorrow'; demain ends in a nasal -ain, with no hard n."}},
